  "about": [
    "The route table of the desk control surface, spec 2026-10-22-desk-control-surface-design.md (Interfaces, 'The route table').",
    "entries: one per built-in name; pluginExceptions: non-built-ins with a fixed route, matched by name and plugin. A non-built-in not listed is run-prompt, or 'self' when its plugin is sminos.",
    "A route's forms.args says whether the trimmed args are required, optional or none; args that break that, or miss forms.pattern (a JS RegExp source matched whole), are bad-args unless the route has 'otherwise', the route those args take instead.",
    "withArgs applies when the trimmed args are non-empty; absent, bare applies to both. measured: M from the probe or the spikes, I otherwise.",
    "Carried from routes-2.1.307.json (carriedFrom) but for the entries named in remeasured, each measured on this engine: a session of 2.1.310 or newer routes by this table, an older one by 2.1.307's.",
    "mcp (2.1.310): the engine resolves a server by its configured name only, spaces included (never by its tool-name spelling); enable and disable without a server, or with all, act on every server, the plugins' own tool servers among them; reconnect needs a server or all, and bare it opens the panel. A server literally named all is not addressable: the grammar reads all as every server."
  ],
